type: software
title: "AlyaAloft: Retrieval-Augmented Document Question Answering with FLAN-T5"
authors:
  - given-names: "Prathamesh Sarjerao"
    family-names: "Vaidya"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8091-4256"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prathameshv07/AlyaAloft"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
date-released: "2025-05-12"
abstract: "A FastAPI system for question answering over PDF documents that combines sentence-embedding retrieval (all-MiniLM-L6-v2), document structure extraction, query-type-aware prompt templates and iterative refinement to obtain grounded answers from a locally run FLAN-T5 model."
keywords:
  - "retrieval-augmented generation"
  - "document question answering"
  - "FLAN-T5"
  - "prompt engineering"
  - "sentence embeddings"
  - "FastAPI"
